        <mxCell id="L0txt" parent="L0" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;public/&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• login.html — đăng nhập&lt;br&gt;• tickets.html, ticket-new.html, ticket-detail.html — 3 màn nghiệp vụ&lt;br&gt;• js/api.js — &lt;b&gt;lớp client API&lt;/b&gt; (Bearer token, mọi màn gọi qua đây)&lt;br&gt;• js/layout.js, js/icons.js, js/ticket-new.js · css/app.css&lt;br&gt;• Express phục vụ static: src/app.js → express.static(&quot;public&quot;)" vertex="1">
