        <mxCell id="L2txt" parent="L2" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" value="• services/ticket.service.js — vòng đời trạng thái, tạo mã BH, phân loại, ưu tiên, SLA&lt;br&gt;• services/customer.service.js · services/auth.service.js&lt;br&gt;• validators/ticket.validator.js, customer.validator.js&lt;br&gt;• utils/phone.js (QT-02), sla.js (QT-04), warranty.js (QT-05), password.js&lt;br&gt;• errors.js (AppError → JSON 4xx)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;=&amp;gt; Toàn bộ QT-01…QT-06, QT-13, QT-15; không import express req/res&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
